+# M4-F03 Engineering Report — Descriptor Terminal Failures, Multi-Agent Ownership & Empirical Recovery
+
+**Milestone:** M4 Follow-Up 03 (M4-F03)  
+**Workspace:** `D:\Class\movie-rcm-system`  
